SUMMARY:Wellness Week at Sylvania
DESCRIPTION:Join Student Engagement and friends for Wellness Week during 
 Spring midterms. Activities will include FREE Self Care Kits and so much 
 more! Supplies provided.Daily from 11am–2pm at the following locations:
 Monday\, April 27: Sylvania CC Main MallWednesday\, April 29: Southeast M
 TH Great HallThursday\, April 30: Cascade Student UnionThursday\, April 3
 0: Rock Creek Bldg 5 Lobby &amp\; Room 122This event is a Drive2Thrive po
 int-earning activity.Learn more about Drive2Thrive at pcc.edu/d2t*This ev
 ent is FREE and in-person only. Only PCC students currently taking classe
 s may participate. Supplies are limited and will be offered on a first-co
 me\, first-served basis at the time of the event. We cannot ship items to
  students and/or set items aside to be picked up later.Wellness Week is b
 rought to you by Student Engagement. The office of Student Engagement is 
 pleased to offer accommodations to ensure that our programs are accessibl
 e and inclusive. Please email a request\, questions\, and thoughts to: pc
 c_engage-group@pcc.edu as soon as possible.—Event Details: https://hub.
 pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382363 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382363)
