DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260427T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260427T150000
SUMMARY:A Movie Day: In Space!
DESCRIPTION:Join the Cascade QRC for a movie day during midterms! Our the
 me is space\, because sometimes we just want to bask in the cosmos for a 
 while. The first movie showing is at 11am and the second movie showing is
  at 1pm. We will have many movie-themed snacks and drinks for everyone. H
