SUMMARY:Computer Basics with Goodwill Industries
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260427T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260427T153000
UID:7d10981c28248c8dae46650decb8d60e@multcolib.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://multcolib.org/sites/default/files/styles
 /medium/public/2025-10/generic_Computers_technology.png?itok=N7qn9WKp
DESCRIPTION:Build a strong foundation in your educational journey by learn
 ing the basics of computer use. Starting with the basics of logging in\, 
