 ongs\, action rhymes\, and playtime\, with bonus socialization for babies 
 and the adults. Attendance is limited and free tickets are available 15 m
 inutes before storytime. Storytime lasts approximately 25 minutes\, follow
 ed by playtime for the rest of the hour.Multnomah County Library storytime
 s are supported by gifts made to The Library Foundation.
