SUMMARY:Take & Make Craft: Zine Making Kit
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260430T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260430T180000
UID:69bc4b521e64afd01e635f95@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Express yourself with a handmade zine in two styles!\nKit incl
 udes\n:\n3 white pages + 3 color pages (colors vary)\nDecorative scrap pap
 er (design varies)\nSewing needle\nEmbroidery thread\nGlue stick\nWashi ta
 pe\nSticker sheet\nYou provide (or borrow during your library visit!):\nSc
 issors\nRuler\nYour favorite writing/drawing tools\nRegister\nto reserve y
 our kit and pick it up at West Slope Library at your convenience any time 
 from April 1st-30th* during the library's open hours. Some kits will also 
 be available for pick up at the library\, no reservation required.\nBe sur
 e to check out Garden Home Library's new zine station later this spring!\n
 These kits are graciously sponsored by the Cultural Coalition of Washingto
 n County and the Oregon Cultural Trust.\nPlease limit 1 kit per person\n.
 \nWe can't wait to see what you create! Send your picture by email to\nwes
 tslope@wccls.org\nor tag us on Instagram @gardenhomecommunitylibrary\n*Res
 erved kits not picked up by April 30th will be offered to those on the wai
 tlist or first come\, first serve at the library.
LOCATION:West Slope Community Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69bc4b521e64afd01e635f95
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
