 s' ability to acknowledge and utilize our privilege and power to better se
 rve clients and communities. Once we look beyond pathologizing models\, we
  can acknowledge the roles that society and other systems play in oppressi
 ng or empowering our clients.</p><p style="line-height: 1.5\;">  Clinician
