DESCRIPTION:Keya Burks\, a candidate in the Doctor of Education in Leaders
 hip Program\, will defend her dissertation at 11:00 AM PT on Friday\, May 
 1\, 2026 online.  Her dissertation is titled "How Do We Stay: The Job Embe
 ddedness Experiences of Professional Black Women\," and the chair of her c
 ommittee is Dr. Brenda Sifuentez.  This event is open to the public.  The 
