 se
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Keya Burks\, a candidate in the Doctor o
 f Education in Leadership Program\, will defend her dissertation at 11:00 
 AM PT on Friday\, May 1\, 2026 online.</p><p>  Her dissertation is titled 
 "How Do We Stay: The Job Embeddedness Experiences of Professional Black Wo
 men\," and the chair of her committee is Dr. Brenda Sifuentez.</p><p>  Thi
 s event is open to the public.</p><p>  The presentation may be viewed via 
 <a href="https://lclark-edu.zoom.us/j/92049579589?pwd=wayhSxwJ8Fg5Uj4IFkJI
 s6tCwsMER9.1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Zoom</a>.</p>
