 r/\n\nVend → cincodemayoportland.com/become-a-vendor/ https://cincodemayo
 portland.com/become-a-vendor/\n\nCapture the Moment: Share your fiesta ex
 periences using #PDXCincoDeMayo for a chance to be featured on our social
  channels!
