X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ananda Portland": "https://anandaportland.org/events/rajarshi-seva-day-at-the-temple/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ananda_portland
X-SOURCE:Ananda Portland
UID:6004835@anandaportland.org
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260502T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260502T133000
DTSTAMP:20260123T185707Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/rajarshi-seva-day-at-the-temple/
SUMMARY:Rajarshi Seva Day at the Temple
DESCRIPTION:Rajarshi Day is named for Rajarshi Janakananda\, the great disc
 iple of Yogananda. He worked and attained material success in the world\, 
 as well as spiritual success and freedom by attunement with his guru.\n\nD
 uring Rajarshi Day we work together to beautify and uplift our temple\,  
 sharing divine friendship\, inspiration\, laughter and attunement to our g
 uru\, Paramhansa Yogananda.\n\nAll are welcome to join in the day. We will
  be serving lunch after our labors. All levels of skills are welcome. Work
  will be done outside and inside\, rain or shine.\n\nSchedule:  8:30 AM -
   coffee and morning treats\n\n8:45 AM - Opening circle and job assignmen
 ts\n\n12:00 - clean up and finishing tasks\n\n12:30 - meditation\n\n12:45 
 - vegetarian lunch\n\n1:30 - final clean up and goodbye\n\n"Even when you 
 are working\, feel that God is working through you\, using your hands\, gu
 iding your feet\, directing your thoughts and feelings. Ask God\, 'What do
  You want from me? Help me\, in every circumstance\, to respond as You wou
 ld respond.' If you live this way\, you will find\, behind all your experi
 ences\, the deep sweetness of God and Guru."Swami Kriyananda\n\nContact Lk
 nox108@gmail.com with any questions.  Please register below to let us kno
 w you are coming.\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/01/Rajarsi-smiling-at-his-desk-with-papers-pkunu2391xftymgka1d81t6v9x66
 qan35rw02p47i8.jpg
CATEGORIES:Service &amp; Satsangs
LOCATION:Ananda Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Avenue\, Beaverton\, Oregon\, 97005
 \, 
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=4855 SW Watson Avenue\, Bea
 verton\, Oregon\, 97005\, ;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda Temple:geo:0,
 0
END:VEVENT
