UID:69d1720bb6c4ac1fedca3acd@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:It’s a pumpkin planting party! (Try to say that three times 
 fast)\nAt this event you will get to plant a pumpkin seed\, receive instru
 ctions on how to grow it\, and enjoy garden themed activities.\nOur hope i
 s you successfully grow a pumpkin plant to bring back for a Pumpkin Harves
 t Party in October. What happens if you don’t successfully grow a pumpki
 n and you want to attend the pumpkin party in October? It’s OK! We will 
 have pumpkins for everyone at the party in October.\nEveryone welcome!\nNo
  registration required.\nThis is an all ages event.
