 d those looking to move beyond automatic camera settings. Participants wil
 l learn the fundamental technical and creative principles that underpin gr
 eat photography. Over the the course\, we will demystify the core function
 s of a camera and explore how to use light\, composition\, and exposure co
 ntrols to capture compelling images.
LOCATION:Northwest Library
