 -path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="0">What we will cover:</strong></p>
 <ul data-path-to-node="13"><li><p data-path-to-node="13\,0\,0"><strong dat
 a-path-to-node="13\,0\,0" data-index-in-node="0">The Editor Persona:</stro
 ng> rewriting for tone\, clarity\, and impact.    </p></li><li><p data-pat
 h-to-node="13\,1\,0"><strong data-path-to-node="13\,1\,0" data-index-in-no
 de="0">The Devil's Advocate:</strong> Using AI to find holes in your logic
  and risks in your plan.    </p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="13\,2\,0"><
 strong data-path-to-node="13\,2\,0" data-index-in-node="0">The Virtual Foc
 us Group:</strong> Simulating stakeholders (students\, admin\, skeptics) t
 o prep for difficult questions.    </p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="14"
 ><strong data-path-to-node="14" data-index-in-node="0">Pre-work:</strong> 
 Please bring one <strong data-path-to-node="14" data-index-in-node="27">"U
 gly Draft"</strong> (an email\, policy\, or proposal that is unfinished or
  rough). We will use the tools to polish it live during the session.</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  Elizabeth Young<br />\n  eayoung@lclark.ed
 u\n</p>
