BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ananda Portland": "https://anandaportland.org/events/morning-group-meditation-2025-12-17-2025-12-18-2025-12-19-2025-12-22-2025-12-23-2025-12-24-2025-12-26-2025-12-29-2025-12-30-2025-12-31-2026-01-01-2026-01-02-2026-01-05-2026-01-06-2026-01-04-2026-05-05/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ananda_portland
X-SOURCE:Ananda Portland
UID:5004052@anandaportland.org
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260505T063000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260505T080000
DTSTAMP:20260123T180231Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/morning-group-meditation-2025-12-17-
 2025-12-18-2025-12-19-2025-12-22-2025-12-23-2025-12-24-2025-12-26-2025-12-
 29-2025-12-30-2025-12-31-2026-01-01-2026-01-02-2026-01-05-2026-01-06-2026-
 01-04-2026-05-05/
SUMMARY:Morning Group Meditation
DESCRIPTION:Weekday mornings we offer a group meditation in the beautiful s
 anctuary of our temple.  Each morning is led by a different member of our
  ministry team with the following flow:\n\n6:15 - doors are open\n\n6:30 -
  opening prayer\, chanting\, reading from Whispers from Eternity by Paramh
 ansa Yogananda\n\n6:40 approx - silent meditation begins\n\n6:45 - front d
 oor is locked\n\n7:55 - 8: 00  -  meditation ends with healing prayers\n
 \n&nbsp\;\n\nThis morning's meditation will have a focus on Rajarsi Janaka
 nanda\, a foremost disciple of Paramhansa Yogananda. Saint Lynn\, as Yogan
 anda called him\, was born on this date in 1892. He was a successful busin
 ess man and also a great yogi who discovered the truth of Self-Realization
  and dedicated each day to finding God through his Guru.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nb
 sp\;\n\nYou are able to leave at anytime if you cannot stay for the entire
  meditation.  We have chairs and a few blankets and cushions available bu
 t you are encouraged to bring your own meditation gear. \n\n&nbsp\;\n\n\n
 \n&nbsp\;\n\n"Group meditation is like a castle which protects spiritual n
 ovices as well as veteran meditators against the besieging armies of delus
 ion. Meditating together increases the degree of Self-realization of each 
 member of the group\, by the law of invisible vibratory exchange of spirit
 ual magnetism."   Paramhansa Yogananda
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 17/04/Rajarsi_lotus.jpg
CATEGORIES:Meditation
LOCATION:Ananda Temple in Beaverton\, 4855 SW Watson Avenue\, Beaverton\, O
 regon\, 97005\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=4855 SW Watson Avenue\, Bea
 verton\, Oregon\, 97005\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda 
 Temple in Beaverton:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
