SUMMARY: The Neon Room at Helium: Dan Docimo
DESCRIPTION:Dan Docimo (they/them) is a standup comic with cute hair and 
 a unique\, disarming style. Dan was listed as a comic to watch as part of
  Time Out’s 2025 Comics on the Rise. They are also a member of the Prime 
 Time Cast at the Lincoln Lodge and producer-drummer of Dumb and Drummer. 
 Most recently\, Dan opened for Louis C.K. at the Chicago Theatre during a
  three-night run. Their credits include performances at the Limestone Com
 edy Festival\, 10\,000 Laughs Festival\, Altercation Comedy Festival\, an
 d Art Basel. Dan loves bringing audiences to tears with their thoughtfull
 y absurd musings. When Dan is not on stage\, you can find them failing at
