X-SOURCE-ID:ananda_portland
X-SOURCE:Ananda Portland
UID:6004936@anandaportland.org
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T203000
DTSTAMP:20260303T020334Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/divine-mother-kirtan/
SUMMARY:Divine Mother Kirtan
DESCRIPTION:Kirtan is a shared time of devotional chanting\, with short per
 iods of meditation. Chanting is a spiritual practice that opens the heart 
 and allows for an experience of deep inner stillness and connection with t
 he divine presence within.\n\nWe will chant together in our beautiful temp
 le sanctuary and celebrate the unconditional love of our Divine Mother.\n\
 nNo experience necessary!  We will share the words to the chants\, which 
 are usually in English and occasionally in Sanskrit. Our musicians use har
 moniums\, guitars and harp.\n\nPlease come and join us for our monthly kir
 tans. All are welcome.\n\nThis is a free event.  Donations are appreciate
 d.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 24/11/krishna-with-mama.jpg
CATEGORIES:Kirtan/Chanting
LOCATION:Ananda Portland Temple\, 4855 SW Watson Ave\, Beaverton\, OR\, 970
 05\, United States
