BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Crystal Ballroom": "https://www.crystalballroompdx.com/events/273740-good-kid-can-we-hang-out-tour/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:crystal_ballroom
X-SOURCE:Crystal Ballroom
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T200000
DTSTAMP:20260424T191224
CREATED:20260401T155518Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260401T155526Z
UID:10001012-1778270400-1778270400@www.crystalballroompdx.com
SUMMARY:Good Kid - Can We Hang Out? Tour
DESCRIPTION:Blending the punchy riffs of J-rock\, the playfulness of indie rock\, and the raw edge of pop-punk\, Good Kid has crafted a sound that’s impossible not to move to. Their ability to spin clever lyrics and sticky melodies into high-energy tracks has turned casual listeners into hardcore fans across the globe. \nGood Kid isn’t your typical rock band; they’re likely the biggest indie act you’ve never heard of. The past two years have been a whirlwind for the band. Between 700+ million streams across their EPs\, a recent JUNO Award nod for “Breakthrough Group”\, a Gold Record and sold-out shows around the world\, they’ve cemented themselves as one of the most exciting acts on the rise. But their music is only part of the story. Good Kid’s real superpower is the deep connection they’ve built with the community that propelled them forward. \n With four popular EPs under their belt\, Good Kid’s debut full-length\, Can We Hang Out Sometime?\, delivers the high-energy hooks and inventive riffs that have become a hallmark of their sound\, while boldly pushing into new territory; longtime fans will find the signature Good Kid bangers they’ve come to love\, but also hear the band exploring fresh textures\, rhythms\, and sonic twists in their grittiest offering yet.
URL:https://www.crystalballroompdx.com/events/273740-good-kid-can-we-hang-out-tour/
CATEGORIES:May
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.crystalballroompdx.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/GoodKid25-0yIGKH.jpg
END:VEVENT
