 30pm<br>Millennium Plaza Park</p><p>Discover the region’s finest agricul
 tural and food products at the Lake Oswego Farmers’ Market. Each week yo
 u’ll find an exceptional selection of fresh produce\, meats\, seafood\, 
 cheeses\, nuts\, artisan breads and pastries\, jams\, salsas\, hummus\, ho
 t foods\, nursery items\, artisan crafts\, and more. There truly is someth
 ing for everyone!</p><p>Enjoy live music from 10:30am–12:30pm\, engage y
