  know whether or not you will attend by completing the registration below\
 , or by emailing timmins@lclark.edu. Please indicate how many members of y
 our family\, including the graduating student\, will be joining us.  If yo
 u have any questions\, please contact Amy Timmins\, Administrative Special
 ist\, at 503-768-7530.  We are look forward to seeing you at the reception
 !
