SUMMARY:Making Waves: The Rise of Asian America - Documentary Screening
DESCRIPTION:Please join APANO\, PCC\, and JACL in welcoming film maker Jo
 n Osaki to Portland\, OR! A screening of his documentary film\, Making Wa
 ves: The Rise of Asian America will be followed by a panel discussion wit
 h Jon and local activists.Read the description below to learn more about 
 the documentary.–Making Waves: The Rise of Asian America explores the v
 ital role of ethnic studies in redefining the narrative and promoting ser
 vice to communities across the country. From the 1968 student strikes at 
 UC Berkeley and San Francisco State to present-day movements\, Making Wav
 es documents the stories of Asian American activism and efforts to lift-u
 p ethnic studies as a strategy to address present and future anti-Asian h
 ate.WATCH THE TRAILER: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J0IHGV1AEGE (https
 ://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J0IHGV1AEGE)—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.
 edu/rsvp?id=382748 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382748)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Please join APANO\, PCC\, and JACL in welcom
 ing film maker Jon Osaki to Portland\, OR! A screening of his documentary
  film\, Making Waves: The Rise of Asian America will be followed by a pan
 el discussion with Jon and local activists.<br />Read the description bel
 ow to learn more about the documentary.<br />–<br />Making Waves: The R
 ise of Asian America explores the vital role of ethnic studies in redefin
 ing the narrative and promoting service to communities across the country
 . From the 1968 student strikes at UC Berkeley and San Francisco State to
  present-day movements\, Making Waves documents the stories of Asian Amer
 ican activism and efforts to lift-up ethnic studies as a strategy to addr
 ess present and future anti-Asian hate.<br />WATCH THE TRAILER: <a href="
 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J0IHGV1AEGE" target="_blank">https://www.
 youtube.com/watch?v=J0IHGV1AEGE</a><br />—<br />Event Details: <a href=
 "https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382748" target="_blank">https://hub.pcc.edu/
 rsvp?id=382748</a>
