DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T163000
SUMMARY:SE Free Food Market
DESCRIPTION:Free Food Markets are community events that center fresh prod
 uce provided by the Oregon Food Bank. We get large orders of produce from
  OFB and add in backstock of non-perishable items to distribute to commun
 ity members. Free Food Market is a one-off event that is scheduled around
  our campus delivery schedule from the OFB. This event is open to all.No 
 ID is needed to attend\, we only ask how many are in their household. We 
 ask that participants bring their own bag or box to transport the food.
 Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382410 (https://hub.pcc.edu/r
 svp?id=382410)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Free Food Markets are community events that 
 center fresh produce provided by the Oregon Food Bank. We get large order
 s of produce from OFB and add in backstock of non-perishable items to dis
 tribute to community members. Free Food Market is a one-off event that is
  scheduled around our campus delivery schedule from the OFB. This event i
 s open to all.<br />No ID is needed to attend\, we only ask how many are 
 in their household. We ask that participants bring their own bag or box t
 o transport the food.<br />—<br />Event Details: <a href="https://hub.p
 cc.edu/rsvp?id=382410" target="_blank">https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382410
 </a>
UID:20260513T223000Z-10042@events.pcc.edu
