SUMMARY:Alumni Virtual Town Hall
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T170000
DTSTAMP:20260416T124032Z
UID:20260513T230000Z-390668@www.lclark.edu
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T160000
ATTACH:https://www.lclark.edu/live/image/gid/194/width/80/height/80/crop/1
 /src_region/0,0,1080,1080/112869_Virtual_Town_Hall_Meeting_v.4.rev.1776704
 433.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Hard to believe it's already been a year! Dean Alicia Ouellett
 e has hit the ground running\, and she's eager to connect with our alumni 
 community to share the law school's latest milestones\, future vision\, an
 d – most importantly – hear directly from you.  Join us to hear about 
 Dean Ouellette's strategic plan for the law school (https://www.lclark.edu
 /about/strategic-plan/) as well as the school's progress. If you'd like to
  submit your question ahead of time to Dean Ouellette\, please fill out ou
 r form here (https://engage.lclark.edu/register/?id=65036112-45ef-4953-a9e
 5-9ce86dae51c8).&#160\;  You must register in advance in order to receive 
 the Zoom link:RSVP here to receive Zoom information (https://lclark-edu.zo
 om.us/meeting/register/_FkNXQpzSrmrSVGj1Ar7LA).&#160\;  After registering\
 , you will receive a confirmation email containing information about joini
 ng the meeting.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260420T170143Z
LOCATION:Zoom
URL:https://www.lclark.edu/calendars/events/event/390668-alumni-virtual-to
 wn-hall
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Hard to believe it's already been a year
 ! <strong>Dean Alicia Ouellette</strong> has hit the ground running\, and 
 she's eager to connect with our alumni community to share the law school's
  latest milestones\, future vision\, and – most importantly – hear dir
 ectly from <strong>you</strong>.</p><p>  Join us to hear about Dean Ouelle
 tte's <a href="https://www.lclark.edu/about/strategic-plan/" target="_blan
 k" rel="noopener">strategic plan for the law school</a> as well as the sch
 ool's progress. If you'd like to submit your question ahead of time to Dea
