X-SOURCE-ID:ananda_portland
X-SOURCE:Ananda Portland
UID:3002136@anandaportland.org
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260517T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260517T094500
DTSTAMP:20241119T010010Z
URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/drop-in-meditation-at-the-temple-2-2
 026-05-17/
SUMMARY:Fire Ceremony and Purification\, Meditation: Drop-In
DESCRIPTION:A Vedic Fire Ceremony and Purification Ceremony is open to all 
 on Sunday mornings at 9:00 am\, followed by meditation. This is offered in
  the sanctuary\, prior to Sunday Service\, which begins at 10 am.\n\nDetai
 ls of these ceremonies can be found HERE.\n\nTwo mantras are repeated seve
 n times\, while ghee and rice are added to the fire. The ghee represents o
 ur heart's devotion and the grains of rice represent our karma that keeps 
 us from perfect union with God. The fire is the divine light that is the s
 ource of all that is. We repeat the mantras with a recording of Swami Kriy
 ananda chanting in Sanskrit.\n\nThe fire ceremony is followed by a Purific
 ation Ceremony and silent meditation which ends at 9:45.\n\nAll are welcom
 e.\nGayatri Mantra\nOm\nBhur bhuvah swah\;\nOm tat savitur varenyam\nbharg
 o devasya dhimahi\ndhiyo yo nah prachodayat.\nOm \nTranslation:\nWe medit
 ate on the Supreme Effulgence\nof the three universes.\nMay It enlighten o
 ur consciousness.\n  \nThe Mahamritunjaya Mantra\nOm\nTriambakam yajamah
 e\nsugandim pushti vardhanam\nurvarukam eva bhandhan\nmrityor mukshiya mam
 ritat\nSwaha.\nTranslation:\nWe worship that One of divine vision\nwho nou
 rishes all living beings.\nMay He free us from death\nand grant us immorta
 lity.\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 20/02/20200217_160359-scaled.jpg
CATEGORIES:Devotional Event,Meditation
LOCATION:Ananda Temple in Beaverton\, 4855 SW Watson Avenue\, Beaverton\, O
 regon\, 97005\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=4855 SW Watson Avenue\, Bea
 verton\, Oregon\, 97005\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda 
 Temple in Beaverton:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
