X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Lewis Clark": "https://www.lclark.edu/live/events/375368-mcafee-is-turning-25-come-for-the-tour-stay-for-the-c"}
X-SOURCE-ID:lewis_clark
X-SOURCE:Lewis Clark
SUMMARY:McAfee is Turning 25: Come for the Tour\, Stay for the Cake!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260520T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260520T140000
DTSTAMP:20260310T093113Z
UID:20260520T190000Z-386455@www.lclark.edu
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260520T120000
ATTACH:https://www.lclark.edu/live/image/gid/220/width/80/height/80/crop/1
 /src_region/0,0,210,136/110981_Screenshot_2025-12-01_at_1.04.16PM.rev.1764
 623172.png
DESCRIPTION:The McAfee Building: From Temporary to Timeless  McAfee arrive
 d on campus in 2001 as a prefabricated single-story office building with a
  basement storeroom. It was never meant to be a permanent fixture on campu
 s\, but over the years\, a funny thing happened: we added a room here\, a 
 renovation there\, and somewhere between the first coat of paint and const
 ructing several additional offices\, the building put down permanent roots
 .  McAfee's offices now include: Advancement (https://college.lclark.edu/g
 iving/contact_us/)\, Communications (https://www.lclark.edu/offices/commun
 ications/staff/)\, Equity and Inclusion (https://www.lclark.edu/about/equi
 ty-and-inclusion/staff/)\, Human Resources (https://www.lclark.edu/offices
 /human_resources/staff/)\, and the Mailroom (https://www.lclark.edu/office
 s/mail_services/).  Please join us as we celebrate this quarter century an
 niversary—acknowledging the staying power of a place that refused to be 
 temporary. It turns out that when you fill a space with enough heart\, his
 tory\, and coffee spills\, it becomes impossible to move.&#160\;
GEO:45.4479004644199;-122.669466498642
LAST-MODIFIED:20260310T163113Z
LOCATION:McAfee
URL:https://www.lclark.edu/live/events/375368-mcafee-is-turning-25-come-fo
 r-the-tour-stay-for-the-c
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<h4>  The McAfee Building: From Temporary to 
 Timeless</h4><p>  McAfee arrived on campus in 2001 as a prefabricated sing
 le-story office building with a basement storeroom. It was never meant to 
 be a permanent fixture on campus\, but over the years\, a funny thing happ
 ened: we added a room here\, a renovation there\, and somewhere between th
 e first coat of paint and constructing several additional offices\, the bu
 ilding put down permanent roots.</p><p>  McAfee's offices now include: <a 
 href="https://college.lclark.edu/giving/contact_us/">Advancement</a>\, <a 
 href="https://www.lclark.edu/offices/communications/staff/">Communications
 </a>\, <a href="https://www.lclark.edu/about/equity-and-inclusion/staff/">
 Equity and Inclusion</a>\, <a href="https://www.lclark.edu/offices/human_r
 esources/staff/">Human Resources</a>\, and the <a href="https://www.lclark
 .edu/offices/mail_services/">Mailroom</a>.</p><p>  Please join us as we ce
 lebrate this quarter century anniversary—acknowledging the staying power
  of a place that refused to be temporary. It turns out that when you fill 
 a space with enough heart\, history\, and coffee spills\, it becomes impos
 sible to move.&#160\;</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:386455
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE:https://www.lclark.edu/live/image/gid/220/width/80/heigh
 t/80/crop/1/src_region/0\,0\,210\,136/110981_Screenshot_2025-12-01_at_1.04
 .16PM.rev.1764623172.png
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE-CAPTION:Birthday Cake
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  Please srop by for a piece of cake and to meet 
 the folks who work in one of the five common-services departments housed u
 nder McAfee's mossy roof.\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/Los_Angeles
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
END:VEVENT
