DESCRIPTION:From season previews and recruiting updates to stories of inte
 rnational competition and professional careers in the NBA and beyond\, the
 se sessions celebrate the journey of the student-athlete and the enduring 
 strength of the L&amp\;C network. Whether you are a fan\, a former athlete
 \, or a supporter of the program\, tune in to hear how we are building a c
 hampionship culture on the field\, in the classroom\, and throughout our c
 ommunity.  This series has two day/time slots: the third Wednesday of ever
 y month at 5:00 PM Pacific Time and Thursdays at 12:00 Pacific Time - Janu
 ary 22nd and then the third Thursdays.Click to Register for one or more of
  the Wednesday sessions (https://engage.lclark.edu/register/?id=fa8548f3-e
 4ce-433f-b0f9-b53e925dea22)Session Dates and Topics:January 21 5:00-6:00 P
 M PT: The Unified Front: From Local Leadership to the World Stage  Februar
 y 18 5:00-6:00 PM PT: Chasing Greatness: Recruitment\, Research\, and the 
 Road to Pro  March 18 5:00-6:00 PM PT: The Big League Path: From Campus In
 ternships to the NBA Front Office  April 15 5:00-6:00 PM PT: Stepping Up t
 o the Plate: Leadership Lessons from L&amp\;C Athletics  May 20 5:00-6:00 
 PM PT: Leading from the Circle: Empowerment and Excellence in Sport  Addit
 ionally to learn more and register for one or more of the sessions taking 
 place on Thursdays at 12:00 Pacific Time\, visit this link (https://engage
 .lclark.edu/register/?id=3f52191c-dccb-40e3-ab98-a0794a499ce5).
