SUMMARY:Spring Men's Retreat
DESCRIPTION:Men’s Retreat  \nMay 22–24\, 2026\n\nJoin us for an inspir
 ing and relaxing two-night men’s retreat in the company of spiritual fri
 ends. We’ll share group meals\, chanting and meditation\, enjoy local hi
 kes and fun activities\, and spend meaningful time together in fellowship.
 \nThis casual retreat is an opportunity for bonding\, spiritual practices\
 , and communion with God both in stillness and in nature\, while enjoying 
 the uplifting company of divine friends.\nCost: $250/person (pay full pric
 e or $50 deposit up front\, full amount due May 1\, 2025)\nIncluded: Two n
 ights accommodations\, meals (prepared together)\nNot included: Transporta
 tion (we will most likely carpool) and other personal expenses\nIf you are
  new to Ananda Portland\, unsure about attending this retreat\, or have an
 y questions\, contact Badri (badri@anandaportland.org)\n&nbsp\;
