 7c613b11a1/69cab92cdc7c9e8f45cad4c1/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Doors at 6:30pm | All Ages | Bar w/ ID | Tickets $40
  adv Premium Seating / $45 dos Premium seating | $35 adv GA / $40 dos GA 
 What I hope people take away from...
