SUMMARY:Free Art in The Park
DESCRIPTION:The Square and Portland creative Larry Yes partner to bring the program Free Art in The Park to downtown Portland on Tuesdays and Thursdays\, June 2 – July 30. Kids\, adults\, neighbors\, families\, and friends are invited to come out in creative spirit to enjoy painting\, music\, fun and meaningful connection.  This free community art series pairs hands-on artistic engagement with live music\, bringing creativity and Portland together on warm summer days in the heart of downtown. Art material provided while supplies last.
