SUMMARY:Community Quilting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T120000
UID:69c2ccc84dacf581ff841682@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Quilters of all skill levels\, join us on the first Saturday o
 f the month to discuss all things quilting with fellow enthusiasts!\nEach 
 month we’ll offer a short presentation\, time for show and tell \n(pleas
 e bring one project to share if you want!)\, and sometimes a \ntake-home c
 hallenge.\nThis month we will explore how to make new fabrics out of your 
 scraps!\n**Community Quilting will take a break in July and August\, and r
 eturn in September.**
LOCATION:Aloha Community Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c2ccc84dacf581ff841682
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
