SUMMARY:In Concert on Downtown’s Transit Mall – Johnny Franco and His Real Brother Dom at Pioneer Place
DESCRIPTION:Johnny Franco and his Real Brother Dom will be performing at Pioneer Place on Downtown’s Transit Mall! Walk down any street in Portland\, Oregon and you are sure to encounter a mustachioed Brazilian rock and roll troubadour named Johnny Franco and (his real brother) Dom. Recently moving from Sao Paulo\, the duo has developed a cult following in Portland for their high energy performance and music. The self-proclaimed Professional Entertainer has sold out his last two headline shows at the Doug Fir in Portland\, Oregon.
