SUMMARY:Yoga Fest at Temple
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe International Day of Yoga and the Sum
 mer Solstice fall on June 21st!\n\nThe Ananda Temple is hosting a Yoga Fes
 t to celebrate. \n🗓 Saturday\, June 20\, 10 AM - 12 PM📍 Ananda Temp
 le\, Portland\nCelebrate the light of the longest day with joy\, energy\, 
 and inner connection at our Summer Solstice Yoga Fest! Sample the full spe
 ctrum of what Ananda has to offer in one inspiring morning:\n✨ Uplifting
  yoga classes🎶 Heart-opening kirtan🧘‍♀️ Guided meditation &amp
 \; relaxation\n*    Power of Mantra\n🍓 Healthy\, delicious snacks🌸
  Community\, connection &amp\; inspiration\nWhether you're brand new to An
 anda or a longtime friend\, this is a perfect time to come together\, try 
 something new\, and celebrate the spiritual light within.\nFree &amp\; ope
 n to all—bring a friend!\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 18/07/Sunflower_2_Large.png
