 ion-at-ananda-village/
SUMMARY:Swami Kriyananda Centennial Celebration at Ananda Village
DESCRIPTION:Stay tuned for events taking place at the Ananda Portland Templ
 e during this week-long celebration. \n\n&nbsp\;\n\nYou’re invited to j
 oin us for a historic\, once-in-a-lifetime celebration honoring the 100th 
 birthday of Swami Kriyananda and the living legacy of Paramhansa Yogananda
 .\n\n&nbsp\;\n\nThe Centennial Celebration\, Ananda’s biggest event ever
 \, takes place June 21–28\, 2026\, at Ananda Village (CA\, USA) and onli
 ne worldwide\, bringing together participants from around the globe in joy
  and inspiration.\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n 	Online participation is free (registrati
 on required)\n 	In-person participation\, including day guests\, requires 
 registration by March 15\, 2026\n\nWatch this short invitation video from 
 Nayaswami Jyotish and Nayaswami Devi.\n\nMore information and registration
 : ananda.org/swami-100 \n\nWe look forward to celebrating together with y
 ou!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/01/Centennial-Image-without-Text-16-9.jpg
END:VEVENT
