  31\, 2026  Tryon Life Community Farm  11640 SW Boones Ferry Rd.  Portland
 \, OR 97219  Our driveway is at the south end of the Tryon Creek State Nat
 ural Area parking lot roughly opposite Coronado St. Drive down the drivewa
 y and park in the spaces on your left. Or walk through Tryon Creek State N
 atural Area to the top of the Horse Loop Trail on Boones Ferry\; then proc
 eed down the driveway. We will meet at the Outdoor Kitchen\, just downhill
  from the parking area.  Info: engagement@tryonfarm.org (mailto:engagement
 @tryonfarm.org)\, text: 503-245-3847
