  Virtual Series</strong>\, a dynamic collection of conversations that brin
 g the L&amp\;C community together from across the globe. This series offer
 s an insider's look at the <strong>"Pursuit of Excellence" within L&amp\;C
  Athletics\, featuring a unique 360-degree perspective from our dedicated 
 coaches\, inspiring current student-athletes\, and successful alumni.</str
 ong>\n</p>
