SUMMARY:Yoga Adventure Camp
DESCRIPTION:Jump into inspiration and fun with Ananda Portland's Yoga Adven
 ture Camp for ages 3-14!                 *details and registratio
 n below\n\nCalling all young yogi adventurers! Ready for an unforgettable 
 summer experience that combines yoga\, meditation\, and fun in the great o
 utdoors? Join us for our Yoga Adventure Camp for kids ages 8-14 (Sun Yogis
  group) and ages 3-7 (Moon Yogis group).\n\n\n\nExplore\, Create\, and Con
 nect\n\nLed by experienced instructors Badri Matlock and Melissa Heart\, o
 ur camp offers a unique blend of activities that foster physical\, emotion
 al\, and creative growth:\n\n- Yoga and meditation sessions tailored to yo
 ung minds and bodies\n- Exciting games\, music\, and arts projects that sp
 ark imagination and creativity\n- Water games and activities for endless f
 un in the sun\n- Local field trips and nature activities to explore the be
 auty of the Pacific Northwest\n\n\n\nA Community of Friendship and Support
 \n\nAt Ananda Portland Yoga Adventure Camp\, we're committed to creating a
  safe\, supportive\, and inclusive environment where kids can thrive. Our 
 experienced team will guide your child through a variety of engaging activ
 ities\, helping them build confidence\, make new friends\, and develop a d
 eeper connection with themselves and the natural world.\n\nWhen: August 3 
 - 7 |  9:30am-1:30pm (Sun group)\, 9:30-12:30 (Moon group) with special c
 ampfire satsang (Sun &amp\; Moon) and overnight campout (Sun group only) o
 n Thursday\, Aug 6\nWhere: Ananda Portland Temple and Teaching Center\, Be
 averton\nWho: Kids ages 8-13 (Sun Yogis group)\, and ages 3-7 (Moon Yogis 
 group)\nWhat to expect: Yoga\, meditation\, games\, music\, arts\, pool ac
 tivities\, field trips\, and more!\n\n \n\nMelissa &amp\; Badri\, Camp Co-
 directors\n\nJoin Us This Summer!\n\nDon't miss this opportunity to give y
 our child the gift of a fun and inspiring summer experience. Join us for A
 nanda Portland's Yoga Adventure Camp and watch them grow into a more confi
 dent\, creative\, and compassionate individual. Register today and let the
  adventure begin!\n\n 	Pricing: $325 or early bird $275 before May 31. Sib
 lings discount less $50 per child.\n 	Inclusive: All snacks\, drinks\, fie
 ld trips\, supplies for all activities included\n 	Meals: Campers bring th
 eir own lunch daily\n 	Devices: No phones\, tablets or other devices\n 	Va
 lues: Kindness\, Friendship\, Adventure and Joy!\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 25/04/anandaportland.org-1920-x-1008-px.png
LOCATION:Ananda Temple in Beaverton\, 4855 SW Watson Avenue\, Beaverton\, O
 regon\, 97005\, United States
