SUMMARY:Monthly Sangha Dinner
DESCRIPTION:\n\nWe invite you to join us for our monthly dinner at the temp
 le.\n\nOn the Second Friday of each month we serve a vegetarian fresh cook
 ed meal prepared by Ananda sangha members. We enjoy good food and good com
 pany in our beautiful temple.\n\nEach meal is $7 for adults and $5 for chi
 ldren 12 and under.\n\nRegister and let us know you are coming so we know 
 how much to prepare!\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
