SUMMARY:Ananda Yoga for Higher Awareness
DESCRIPTION:Ananda Yoga for Higher Awareness is a gentle\, inward-focused y
 oga practice designed to calm the body\, refine the breath\, and lift awar
 eness. Through relaxed postures\, conscious breathing\, and subtle energy 
 awareness\, this practice supports meditation and attunement to higher sta
 tes of consciousness.\nSaturdays\, 11:00am–12:30pm\, this class is suita
 ble for all levels and is especially supportive for those seeking inner st
 illness\, balance\, and a deeper spiritual connection through yoga.\n
