SUMMARY:Evening of Remembrance
DESCRIPTION:The Evening of Remembrance is an Ananda Portland tradition. Thi
 s is a deep and peaceful time of shared memories\, loving prayers\, and sw
 eet remembrance of beloved souls who have passed from this world.\n\nThere
  will be readings\, music\, meditation\, and an Astral Ascension ceremony 
 for all.\n\nIncluded is a slide show of pictures of our loved ones. Please
  submit pictures for the slideshow to lorna@anandaportland.org by Oct 25th
 .
