SUMMARY:Men's Monthly Kriyaban Meditation
DESCRIPTION:Open to all Ananda Kriyabans (those initiated into kriya yoga t
 hrough Ananda). This men's group will meet once a month in our beautiful t
 emple for meditation and shared support in our spiritual path of kriya yog
 a.\n\nScheduled on the second Wednesday of each month\, beginning January 
 14\, 2026.\n\nLed by co-director of Ananda Portland\, Badri Matlock. Pleas
 e contact Badri with any questions. Badri@anandaportland.org
