SUMMARY:Thanksgiving Potluck
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to join us in celebrating Thanksgiving with fri
 ends and delicious food. We will express our gratitude for the ever-presen
 t Divine Abundance in our beautiful temple\, with divine friends.\n\nPleas
 e sign up on our spread sheet so we know what dish you plan to bring. We a
 sk that all dishes be vegetarian.\n\nClick here to register\n\nHelpers for
  set up and clean up are always needed and the spreadsheet includes those 
 as well.\n\nWe look forward with gratitude to this joyful time!\n\n&nbsp\;
 \n\n&nbsp\;\n\n&nbsp\;
