URL:https://anandaportland.org/events/christmas-day-meditation/
SUMMARY:Christmas Day Meditation
DESCRIPTION:Meditate in the sacred space of the Temple sanctuary on this ho
 ly day.\n\nJoin Lorna and others for all or part of this morning's meditat
 ion and go deep into the presence of Christ as the blessings flow through 
 all creation.\n\nRecorded chants or Christmas music may be played\, but mo
 st of the time will be silent meditation.\n\nNo registration necessary.\n\
 n&nbsp\;
