SUMMARY:Morning Group Meditation
DESCRIPTION:Weekday mornings we offer a group meditation in the beautiful s
 anctuary of our temple.  Each morning is led by a different member of our
  ministry team with the following flow:\n\n6:15 - doors are open\n\n6:30 -
  opening prayer\, chanting\, reading from Whispers from Eternity by Paramh
 ansa Yogananda\n\n6:40 approx - silent meditation begins\n\n6:45 - front d
 oor is locked\n\n7:55 - 8: 00  -  meditation ends with healing prayers\n
 \n&nbsp\;\n\nYou are able to leave at anytime if you cannot stay for the e
 ntire meditation.  We have chairs and a few blankets and cushions availab
 le but you are encouraged to bring your own meditation gear. \n\n&nbsp\;\
 n\n\n\n&nbsp\;\n\n"Group meditation is like a castle which protects spirit
 ual novices as well as veteran meditators against the besieging armies of 
 delusion. Meditating together increases the degree of Self-realization of 
 each member of the group\, by the law of invisible vibratory exchange of s
 piritual magnetism."   Paramhansa Yogananda
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://anandaportland.org/wp-content/uploads/20
 22/02/Group-Meditation-4.jpg
CATEGORIES:Meditation
LOCATION:Ananda Temple in Beaverton\, 4855 SW Watson Avenue\, Beaverton\, O
 regon\, 97005\, United States
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=4855 SW Watson Avenue\, Bea
 verton\, Oregon\, 97005\, United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE=Ananda 
 Temple in Beaverton:geo:0,0
END:VEVENT
